sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Kubernetes
    participant O as VM operator
    participant E as External guest evictor
    participant S as SPIRE server
    K->>O: VM deletion timestamp / immutable UID
    O->>K: Delete exactly owned guest registrations
    alt Evictor configured
        O->>K: Stop own VM Pods, respecting storage guard draining
        K-->>O: Observe no owned VM Pods
        O->>E: VM UID / exact workload mTLS
        E->>S: Require registrations gone, match VM DevID selectors
        S-->>E: Scoped eviction outcome
        E-->>O: Success or pending / unavailable
        alt Eviction succeeds
            O->>K: Release guest-identity finalizer
        else Still pending after 600 seconds from deletion start
            O->>K: Warning GuestAgentNotEvicted, release this finalizer
        end
    else No evictor configured
        O->>K: Release after owned entry cleanup
    end
    Note over K,S: Other finalizers and already-issued credential lifetimes remain separate
